ol (so someone can drive it)<br /> 4pt: Mobile (lets it move)<br /> 25pt: extra cost for Mobility<br /> 5pt: Indestructible(so it doesn't break when you crash it)<br /> <br /> When it is actually moving all of those points must be supplied by other manses in the grid. They can each provide as many points as their rating, but they need<br /> 1pt: Network Node<br /> 1pt: Geomantic Relay (taken [rating] times)<br /> <br /> If you want it to fly:<br /> Replace 25pt: extra cost for Mobility<br /> With 50pt: extra cost for Mobility with flight","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}